  System.Minizip.C.adam - minizip's C API (Gilles Vollant, zlib license;
  zlib's contrib/minizip at tag v1.4), written by `adam cimport` from the
  ioapi.h / zip.h / unzip.h libminizip.a is built with
  (res/libs/vendor/include/minizip) with the headers' own names: the
  file-function tables, the zip writer's and the unzip reader's records
  laid out as C lays them out, every routine `external "minizip"`
  (libminizip.a in res/libs/vendor/<triple>, built by AdamLang-Libs). The
  headers include zlib.h, so zlib's declarations are System.Zlib.C's
  (imported); minizip calls zlib, so the unit names libzlib.a with
  @linklibrary. Do not edit: a change belongs in the spec,
  res/cimport/System.Minizip.C.cimport.toml, then regenerate.
*******************************************************************************/

